D4. The solution trajectory of this problem can be interpreted as a geodesic. (Heidelberg archive). 
Annotation. Discusses the Riemannian metric for distance from thermodynamic equilibrium and optimized trajectories. Supports the interpretation of minimum-dissipation reconciliation as a geodesic problem.

